    "body": "> Can you describe the motivation a bit better? From that bug it sounds like this might allow for some simplification of layout/paint code?\r\n\r\nIt doesn't really simplify anything. Iff we wanted to fix this and UA stylesheets were not an option then we'd complicate layout a bit, which would be a bit unfortunate for this odd edge case :)",
