    "created_at": "2020-06-04T12:50:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-04T12:50:42Z",
    "body": "There are only two resizable situations which have a fixed size I can think of:\r\n1. width = min-width = max-width, height = min-height = max-height;\r\n2. fullscreen;\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if there are any other situations.\r\n",
